class=\"content\">\n        <a class=\"affiliation cnrs\" href=\"https://www.cnrs.fr/en\" title=\"CNRS - Centre National de la Recherche Scientifique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a class=\"affiliation unistra\" href=\"https://www.unistra.fr/\" title=\"Universit\u00c3\u00a9 de Strasbourg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><a class=\"affiliation obas\" href=\"https://astro.unistra.fr/\" title=\"Observatoire astronomique de Strasbourg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"legal-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://cds.unistra.fr/about/contact/\">Contact</a> - <a href=\"https://cds.unistra.fr/legals/\">Legals</a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</body></html>\n"
